WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.436 --> 00:00:03.320
Lesson six. Our House!

2
00:00:04.239 --> 00:00:11.372
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.366 --> 00:00:15.231
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:18.250
Today we learn: Our House! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.975 --> 00:00:22.292
Kitchen! Say it with me. Kitchen!

6
00:00:26.285 --> 00:00:30.185
Bedroom! Say it with me. Bedroom!

7
00:00:34.199 --> 00:00:37.832
Bathroom! Say it with me. Bathroom!

8
00:00:41.892 --> 00:00:45.925
Living room! Say it with me. Living room!

9
00:00:49.884 --> 00:00:53.351
Garden! Say it with me. Garden!

10
00:00:57.351 --> 00:01:00.751
Roof! Say it with me. Roof!

11
00:01:04.725 --> 00:01:08.075
Door! Say it with me. Door!

12
00:01:12.111 --> 00:01:15.877
Window! Say it with me. Window!

13
00:01:19.874 --> 00:01:26.077
Listen. Where is the kitchen? It is here.

14
00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:30.589
Say it with me. Where is the kitchen? It is here.

15
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:40.797
We watch TV together with family in the living room. Flowers grow in our garden.

16
00:01:40.847 --> 00:01:42.187
I like this story!

17
00:01:43.013 --> 00:01:48.328
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.378 --> 00:01:49.528
Bathroom!

19
00:01:50.612 --> 00:01:55.884
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:55.934 --> 00:01:57.084
Roof!

21
00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:03.553
Value corner: Respect. Listening to others and treating them well shows respect.

22
00:02:03.603 --> 00:02:05.256
I can show respect too!

23
00:02:06.244 --> 00:02:13.347
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:13.397 --> 00:02:14.983
Bye-bye, friends!

